<div id="urduTextPath">(ع) ابو طالب/ائے کفیلِ نبی ابو طالب</div>

Aye kafeel e nabi abu taalib<br>
Sayyade hashmi abu taalib<br>
Deen ki zindagi abu taalib<br>
Jaan imaan ki abu taalib<br>
<br>
Aamena ke hai phool ko paala <br>
Tu ne rab ke rasool ko paala<br>
<br>
Baara farzand tere hai jo imaam<br>
Jin se jaari hai haq rasi ka nizaam<br>
Tera aaghaaz bhi hai khush anjaam<br>
Tujh ko kehte hai mohsin e islaam<br>
<br>
Jaari haq ka sabaq tujhi se hai<br>
Haq to ye hai ke haq tujhi se hai<br>
<br>
Wo jo quraa'n ki aayat se pehli<br>
Jo ke qable rasool tu ne padhi<br>
Hai daleel ek tere imaa'n ki<br>
Tera alhamdulillah kehna bhi<br>
<br>
Roohe imaa'n bane tere jumle <br>
Aayatou me dhale tere jumle<br>
<br>
Naat goyi ke qaaliq o baani<br>
Zaat teri hai zaat e irfaani <br>
Tujh se zaahir hai qoo e imaani<br>
Kulle imaan hai tera jaani<br>
<br>
Nekh seerat hai nekh baqt hai tu<br>
Kalma goyou ka sar parast hai tu<br>
<br>
Log barish ki the dua karte<br>
Tere ash'aar ke waseele se<br>
Kibriyaai sifaat the tere<br>
Jaari hai tere faiz ke chashme<br>
<br>
Aap baara ke haq me heela hai<br>
Kitna mahkoom tera waseela hai<br>
<br>
Tujh se khaate the qouf baani e shar<br>
Tera dar tha laeenou ke upar<br>
Bu lahab bu jehal se taqatwar<br>
Kaamp jate the naam ko sun kar<br>
<br>
Kufr ka zor kuch dikha na sake<br>
Wo mohammed pe hath utha na sake<br>
<br>
Tha unhe yu rasool par ghussa<br>
Bud parasti par kyu kiya hamla<br>
Kyu kaha ek hai quda sab ka<br>
Kyu padha la ilaaha ilallah<br>
<br>
Ek dil mashr keene makka the<br>
Dar paye jaa'n nabi ke aada the<br>
<br>
Chahte the mitaade naame nabi<br>
Koshish unki thi har qadam pe yahi<br>
Tu ne jis dam nabi ki li pushti<br>
Khal gayi unko ye ada teri<br>
<br>
Us himaayat ka badla lete hai<br>
Dukh tujhe aaj bhi wo dete hai<br>
<br>
Tujhpe ilzaam kufr ka dharna<br>
Hai saqeefaai ek mansooba<br>
Tohmatou ke sahare par aada<br>
Aaj tak bhi hai dar paye eeza<br>
<br>
Qoon me unke jo najasat hai <br>
Dil me unke teri adaawat hai<br>
<br>
Tere dushman hai nasl e be tehqeeq<br>
Ho chuki jin ke jhoot ki tasdeeq<br>
Deen me ghus gaye the kuch zandeeq<br>
Koi farooq aur koi sadeeq<br>
<br>
Laanate unpe bheja karte hai<br>
Momin unpe tabarra karte hai<br>
<br>
Tera saaya jo uth gaya aaqa<br>
Ho gaye qud rasool be saaya<br>
Mera baba mera chacha na raha<br>
Kehte hai roke ye rasool e quda<br>
<br>
Kya musibat nabi pe aayi hai<br>
Shaaq dil par teri judaayi hai<br>
<br>
Dil se ho kar malool rote hai<br>
Baagh e zehra ke phool rote hai<br>
Ba safa ba usool rote hai<br>
Tere gham me rasool rote hai<br>
<br>
Tera ehsaa'n nibha rahe hai nabi<br>
Teri mayyat utha rahe hai nabi<br>
<br>
Koi hamdard tujh sa ab na raha<br>
Gham se behaal hai rasool e quda<br>
Hai digar haal gham se moula ka<br>
Uth gaya sar se baap ka saaya<br>
<br>
Aaj haq ke wali yateem huwe<br>
Haye moula ali yateem huwe<br>
<br>
Roye gham me tere rasool e quda<br>
Apne hathou se tujh ko kafnaaya<br>
Tere taaboot ko diya kaandha<br>
Tera kis shaan se janaza utha<br>
<br>
Jab sawaari makaan se uthhi<br>
Teri mayyat bhi shaan se uthhi<br>
<br>
Chot gham ki jo dil pe hai khayi<br>
Karbala ne hai shakl dikhlaayi<br>
Gham e sarwar ki hai fizaa chaayi<br>
Bekasi e hussain yaad aayi<br>
<br>
Qalb e zehra ke chain ka laasha<br>
Bekafan tha hussain ka laasha